    "title": "Launcher OS 18",
    "description": "Bring a lightweight and smooth launching experience to your smartphone.\r\n\r\n<b>Require Secure - A New Feature You've Been Waiting For</b> \r\n     * This feature allows you to hide apps from the home screen, accessible only from the app library after authentication.\r\n     * It offers an easy way to lock apps with a simple setup, and best of all, no background services are required, ensuring your phone\u2019s battery life remains unaffected.\r\n\r\n<b>Why should you use this app?</b>\r\n    * Beautiful bright user interface, easy to manage, easy to use\r\n    * Easily access widgets with the first page dedicated to displaying widgets\r\n    * Easily organize apps by simply holding and dragging them anywhere\r\n    * The app library helps you intelligently organize them for easy access\r\n    * Secure your apps with the app hiding and app lock feature\r\n    * Supports renaming and customizing app icons to better personalize your phone\r\n    * Quickly search for apps by swiping down from the home screen\r\n    * Easily change and manage wallpapers\r\n\r\n<b>Permissions</b>\r\n    * BILLING, INTERNET remove ads and support our development team\r\n    * QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES to display applications\r\n    * ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION to display weather info at your location.\r\n\r\n<b>Feedback</b>\r\nIf you encounter any issues while using this app, please let us know, and we will check and update as soon as possible\r\nEmail: gricemobile@gmail.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Bring a lightweight and smooth launching experience to your smartphone.<br><br><b>Require Secure - A New Feature You&#39;ve Been Waiting For</b> <br>     * This feature allows you to hide apps from the home screen, accessible only from the app library after authentication.<br>     * It offers an easy way to lock apps with a simple setup, and best of all, no background services are required, ensuring your phone\u2019s battery life remains unaffected.<br><br><b>Why should you use this app?</b><br>    * Beautiful bright user interface, easy to manage, easy to use<br>    * Easily access widgets with the first page dedicated to displaying widgets<br>    * Easily organize apps by simply holding and dragging them anywhere<br>    * The app library helps you intelligently organize them for easy access<br>    * Secure your apps with the app hiding and app lock feature<br>    * Supports renaming and customizing app icons to better personalize your phone<br>    * Quickly search for apps by swiping down from the home screen<br>    * Easily change and manage wallpapers<br><br><b>Permissions</b><br>    * BILLING, INTERNET remove ads and support our development team<br>    * QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES to display applications<br>    * ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION to display weather info at your location.<br><br><b>Feedback</b><br>If you encounter any issues while using this app, please let us know, and we will check and update as soon as possible<br>Email: gricemobile@gmail.com",
